   "source": [
    "## Q1 Average, Median and Standard Deviation of House Prices"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "7bf344a5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "avg_price = df['Price'].mean()\n",
    "median_price = df['Price'].median()\n",
    "std_price = df['Price'].std()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Average:\", avg_price)\n",
    "print(\"Median:\", median_price)\n",
    "print(\"Standard Deviation:\", std_price)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5e2e08c2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Q2 Most Common Number of Bedrooms"
